  <Class>EC.02.05.05</Class>
  <Text>During review of PM (preventiative maintenace) test records for utility system, it was revealed that ICE machines and other items must be tested at an assigned interval. The PM requirements indicate that Ice machines will be inspected monthly and semi-annually. The test documentation did not indicate that these insepections have been done since June 2012. NOTE: The organization was cited on this item last TJC survey.</Text>
